# EGT sweep artefacts are reproducible outputs, not records: one `(t, α)`
# sweep writes hundreds of files (per-run ess/invasion/faces/nash directories,
# figures, parquet), and re-running the same sweep regenerates them exactly —
# the run directory name embeds a hash of the cells it analysed.
#
# This is deliberately narrower than ignoring `app/generated/`, which tracks
# constructor proposals and outcome transcripts on purpose (longitudinal
# thesis data that cannot be regenerated).
#
# Keep a result set by copying it out, or point `--out-root` elsewhere.
runs/
sweep_summary.json
